# Accessibility & SEO

- Use semantic HTML and a correct heading hierarchy.
- Accessible navigation; keyboard-accessible interactive elements; proper button vs link usage.
- Meaningful alt text; labeled form controls; visible focus states.
- Descriptive page metadata; canonical when applicable; crawlable HTML.
- Do not rely on JavaScript for content that should be in HTML.
- Keep SEO simple — no unnecessary complexity.
